mov n, 5 makes n 5, and var spare is 0
mov copy_of_n, n makes it 5, and mov word holds abas
after cls the stack holds 0 word(s)
after a function that cleared its own scratch 0
after clv, n is a new name holding 6
a jump to a flag before clf:   and it landed
after clf kept:   the jump above is the one to unhash
after clf:   the call and the jump above are the ones to unhash
after clf, n still holds 8
after clear the stack holds 0 word(s)
